        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0094">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the resin in these examples</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">included 37.5 wt % 1,6-hexanediol diacrylate (HDDA), 62.5 wt % PEG400, 0.3 wt % lrg 819 of HDDA.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0094">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the curing condition</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was 405 nm light, 14.5 mw/cm 2 for 30s.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0094">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">FIG. 15</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">illustrates more complex structures.</span>
